is terrible!"

2
00:00:14.353 --> 00:00:15.073
said Mayor Bloom.

3
00:00:16.414 --> 00:00:18.776
"The Ultra Car is destroying the city!"

4
00:00:18.796 --> 00:00:21.878
"My poor Ruby!"

5
00:00:22.138 --> 00:00:22.639
cried Mrs.

6
00:00:22.679 --> 00:00:25.401
Cash. "My poor car!"

7
00:00:25.621 --> 00:00:26.501
cried the inventor.

8
00:00:26.521 --> 00:00:28.703
"My poor city!"

9
00:00:29.003 --> 00:00:29.824
cried Mayor Bloom.

10
00:00:30.812 --> 00:00:31.773
"Rocket Girl!"

11
00:00:32.073 --> 00:00:32.993
said Detective Smith.

12
00:00:33.013 --> 00:00:36.334
"You must Rocket Girl?"

13
00:00:37.475 --> 00:00:39.976
Zoom! Roxy shot through the air.

14
00:00:40.896 --> 00:00:43.137
She flew toward downtown as fast as she could.

15
00:00:44.258 --> 00:00:46.879
Up ahead, she saw black smoke fill the sky.

16
00:00:46.899 --> 00:00:50.320
"Something's burning!"

17
00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:51.200
thought Roxy.

18
00:00:52.181 --> 00:00:54.342
She used her super vision to see through the smoke.

19
00:00:55.642 --> 00:00:56.943
Cars were burning in the street.

20
00:00:58.103 --> 00:00:59.404
A building was on fire too.

21
00:01:00.732 --> 00:01:02.213
A fruit cart lay on its side.

22
00:01:03.773 --> 00:01:05.554
Several store windows had been smashed.

23
00:01:06.695 --> 00:01:08.836
A sleek car rocketed down West Street.

24
00:01:10.216 --> 00:01:11.457
It had wings and rockets.

25
00:01:11.477 --> 00:01:14.918
"That must be the Ultra Car!"

26
00:01:15.038 --> 00:01:15.698
thought Roxy.

27
00:01:16.719 --> 00:01:19.220
Whoosh! She flew toward it.

28
00:01:20.641 --> 00:01:23.362
Crash! The car smashed a donut stand.

29
00:01:24.162 --> 00:01:25.363
Donuts flew everywhere.

30
00:01:25.383 --> 00:01:28.544
"Ugh!" cried the donut maker.

31
00:01:29.212 --> 00:01:32.653
"It took me all morning to make those donuts!"

32
00:01:34.474 --> 00:01:36.155
Roxy used her super vision again.

33
00:01:37.475 --> 00:01:40.297
She peered into the Ultra Car and saw a young girl.

34
00:01:41.237 --> 00:01:42.958
The girl wore diamond sunglasses.

35
00:01:42.978 --> 00:01:47.139
"That's Ruby Cash," thought Roxy.

36
00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:50.060
The car swerved all over the street.

37
00:01:51.241 --> 00:01:52.061
Ruby laughed.

38
00:01:53.682 --> 00:01:55.282
Roxy flew alongside the car.

39
00:01:55.302 --> 00:01:58.044
"Ruby, stop the car!"

40
00:01:58.264 --> 00:01:58.784
she cried.

41
00:01:59.848 --> 00:02:00.688
"No way!"

42
00:02:01.089 --> 00:02:01.709
cried Ruby.

43
00:02:01.729 --> 00:02:04.090
"This is fun!"

44
00:02:05.911 --> 00:02:09.292
Smash! The Ultra Car crashed through a fountain.

45
00:02:10.413 --> 00:02:12.053
Startled pigeons flew everywhere.

46
00:02:12.074 --> 00:02:16.616
"Woo-hoo!" shouted Ruby as the car zoomed forward.

47
00:02:17.456 --> 00:02:21.918
Screech! The Ultra Car skidded back onto the street.

48
00:02:24.499 --> 00:02:29.372
It almost hit a woman carrying a cat.

49
00:02:29.392 --> 00:02:30.312
"Crazy driver!"

50
00:02:30.452 --> 00:02:31.233
the woman shouted.

51
00:02:31.253 --> 00:02:33.393
"Watch where you're going!"

52
00:02:33.413 --> 00:02:35.974
"Meow!" yelped the cat.

53
00:02:35.994 --> 00:02:38.695
"Don't yell at me!"

54
00:02:39.075 --> 00:02:39.775
Ruby shouted.

55
00:02:39.795 --> 00:02:44.216
"I have to stop that car before someone gets hurt!"

56
00:02:44.457 --> 00:02:45.137
said Roxy.

57
00:02:47.077 --> 00:02:49.578
She flew ahead of the Ultra Car and landed in the street.

58
00:02:50.898 --> 00:02:53.359
She held up her hands as the car raced toward her.

59
00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:55.860
Zap! Zap!

60
00:02:56.456 --> 00:02:59.519
Laser beams shot from the car's headlights and blasted Roxy.

61
00:03:00.579 --> 00:03:02.921
She tumbled backward and crashed into a mailbox.

62
00:03:02.941 --> 00:03:07.065
"This car is totally fabulous," said Ruby.

63
00:03:07.085 --> 00:03:09.567
"I'll tell Mother to buy it for me.

64
00:03:09.587 --> 00:03:13.109
I don't care how much it costs—oh no!"

65
00:03:14.491 --> 00:03:15.551
Roxy jumped to her feet.

66
00:03:16.652 --> 00:03:18.934
The Ultra Car was racing straight toward a bus.

67
00:03:20.375 --> 00:03:23.518
Roxy could see Terrell, Jack, and Mara on the bus.

68
00:03:25.119 --> 00:03:26.240
"Rocket Girl, help!"

69
00:03:26.648 --> 00:03:27.269
cried Ruby.

70
00:03:27.289 --> 00:03:29.854
"I can't stop this car!"

71
00:03:31.397 --> 00:03:32.178
Roxy gulped.

72
00:03:33.541 --> 00:03:35.985
"Ruby's going to crash into my friends!"
